[[01:05:18]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DpyCQEaEWQ0&t=3918s) requirements, um, they exist in the ad in the, um, unified development code right now. Um, ADUs are allowed as an administrative use in all of our normal residential zones. Um and a they are

